  "editorialSummary": "Nothing captures the delicate balance of modern existence quite like [Nvidia CEO's resignation](https://oglobo.globo.com/economia/noticia/2026/11/12/ceo-da-nvidia-renuncia.ghtml) triggering a tech-market meltdown while [European school bomb hoaxes](https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/11/12/italy-evacuates-schools-in-second-day-of-bomb-threats_6778906_4.html) paralyze infrastructure and [Spanish housing protests](https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/12/spain-approves-housing-reforms-after-nationwide-strike-over-costs?traffic_source=rss) erupt in the streets. At least the researchers mapping the [basal ganglia brain atlas](https://english.elpais.com/science-tech/2026-11-12/scientists-create-largest-ever-map-of-brain-region-tied-to-parkinsons-alzheimers-schizophrenia-and-autism.html) now have a pristine neurological blueprint of whatever is driving us to design this circus.",
